n\nRoot Codex is the single ongoing operator proxy keeping RC1 driving ABG's RC2\nbuild and evaluating progress; no separate proxy agent will launch. Only\naccepted changes executed through ABG count as output. Bugs, workarounds,\nretries, interventions, time and available usage/cost remain visible. Missing\nRoot/session cost stays unknown; no provider calls occurred in this release\npreparation. A small first success is path proof, not overall productivity.\n\nSource: `5b793c65e5c85ad76cf7eb45bef98263f95c00cb`.\nTarball SHA-256: `1ab469106e27a693c1720f3e0a76e605a3ba03168d89f49dd7dee4c2665696e9`.\nThe package remains private; no npm registry publication is selected.\n"}